  concept: "Authored objective: Main power restored and charging.\nAuthored requirement:
    MAIN restored, load powered by main diode and positive charging current observed.
    current \u2265 2 mA. Conduction required.\nGeneral teaching principle: Electrical
    measurements are differences or flows that require a correct reference, operating
    condition and fresh solver evidence.\nOnly fresh, authoritative game evidence
    can establish that this objective is complete."
  analogy: A pressure gauge needs a reference; a voltage measurement likewise depends
    on its defined points.
